      "writtenOn": "2024-01-10T00:41:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, that is the plan. Probably a file for image, a file for buffer, a file for command buffer, a file for external memory / AHB, and maybe a file for sync? Then we put the remainings to BasicTests.\n\nI do plan to add a significant amount of image tests. Just by looking at the gapid implementation it seems vk images have tons of corner cases.",
