      "writtenOn": "2024-01-19T01:28:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The interfaces for crosvm seem to be:\n\nhttps://crosvm.dev/doc/vm_control/fn.do_snapshot.html\nhttps://crosvm.dev/doc/vm_control/fn.do_restore.html\n\nUpstream QEMU uses a QMP protocol for snapshots: \n\nhttps://wiki.qemu.org/Features/Snapshots\nhttps://www.qemu.org/docs/master/interop/qemu-qmp-ref.html#qapidoc-2174\n\nMaybe `stream_renderer_snapshot_save(char** snapshot_dir, uint32_t num_dirs)` + `stream_renderer_snapshot_load(char** snapshot_dir, uint32_t num_dirs)` is a good unstable API given this?",
