      "side": 1,
      "message": "I will put them into the design doc as a feature request from crosvm and implement them later. Currently it is too early to say what API would be the best for AEMU. After many years of usage we found caveats of existing APIs and is proposing to rework it. In the worst scenario we could use `stream_renderer_snapshot_save(char** snapshot_dir, uint32_t num_dirs)` for crosvm and a different API for AEMU, then internally make them call the same snapshot API.",
