    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1b01f367_850c7bf1",
        "filename": "guest/vulkan_enc/ResourceTracker.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 20
      },
      "lineNbr": 3996,
      "author": {
        "id": 1101621
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-12T17:24:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With `stream_renderer_export_blob` you would have two pointers to the same memory, since you would be using external memory to add another kernel-level reference. \n\nFor example, the ASG ring buffer is shared with the guest via map blob operation (\"guest mapping\"), and the host-side ASG ring buffer view is kept internal in gfxstream (\"gfxstream mapping\").\n\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/platform/hardware/google/gfxstream/+/refs/heads/main/host/virtio-gpu-gfxstream-renderer.cpp#1693\n \nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/crosvm/+/refs/heads/main/devices/src/virtio/gpu/virtio_gpu.rs#712\n \nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/crosvm/+/refs/heads/main/rutabaga_gfx/src/gfxstream.rs#315 \n\nTo emulate live migration, one could possibly call in the test backed:\n\n1) stream_renderer_snapshot_save --\u003e copies content of all virtio-gpu resources to a file\n2) stream_renderer_teardown(),stream_renderer_init(..) --\u003e this emulates tearing down a guest, and restarting the guest\n\n3) Maybe in the test code, you would zero out the \"guest mapping\" here of the `VkDeviceMemory`\n\n4) stream_renderer_snapshot_restore --\u003e recreate all virtio-gpu resources, and if needed host side pointers (i.e, for the \"gfxstream mapping\" of the ASG ring).  For Vulkan memory, you\u0027ll need to recreate the `VkDeviceMemory`, but not the pointer: gfxstream doesn\u0027t itself read from the memory, but the GPU does.\n\nAfter (4), the memory should match the memory contents before (1), even though the zero\u0027ing operation was performed in (3).\n\nOther test back-ends that make use of external memory are vtest/virglrenderer, which uses a client/server model and sends fds between them:\n\nhttps://gitlab.freedesktop.org/virgl/virglrenderer/-/blob/main/vtest/vtest_renderer.c?ref_type\u003dheads#L1191",
      "parentUuid": "d065c0a1_72ea0069",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3963,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 3996,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "b79b81d727e0c135608573f20c2d8c53e74d83cb",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "66fc16d0_d1b4edd0",
        "filename": "guest/vulkan_enc/ResourceTracker.cpp",
