      "writtenOn": "2024-01-13T00:16:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, we would have to improve the e2e tests backend to better emulate the real world scenario, but I do think it\u0027s technically feasible.\n\nAnother solution that doesn\u0027t involve changing the `./gfxstream_unittest.cpp` to test aspects of this.  This would be similar to what https://crrev.com/c/4853266 does: which tests the host side rutabaga API only.  That would avoid adding too many special cases for end2end tests that we\u0027ll eventually have to roll back.",
      "parentUuid": "66fc16d0_d1b4edd0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3963,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 3996,
