      "writtenOn": "2024-01-16T23:30:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The focus here is to test VkDecoderSnapshot and VkReconstruction instead of rutabaga, and we do want to trigger it from guest side API since follow-up vk tests are going to depend on it. Due to the difference between e2e tests backend and real-world scenario, we could only provide, I would say, 50% test coverage. But it is still better than 0% coverage, and it unblocks the rest of the e2e tests.\n\nOf course, at the end of the day, we will need other tests to cover the rest (might be shared memory unittests, or could be integration tests with a full vm).",
      "parentUuid": "3b347806_680cb0ef",
      "range": {
