      "writtenOn": "2024-01-19T01:28:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One option is modify the test to:\n\n1) Create 2 linear Vulkan images: one for uploading (memory1, image1) and destination (memory2, image2)\n2) Upload data memory1 (map)\n3) Blit from image1 from image2\n4) unmap memory1, destroy image1 and memory1\n5) Snapshot save + snapshot load\n6) Map memory2 after restore \n7) Verify pixels\n\nI think that *should* let you avoid modifications to ResourceTracker.cpp for the sake of the tests.  Long-term, we\u0027ll need to improve the testing layer.",
